  "question": {
    "text": "Let M be a <math><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> symmetric matrix with integer entries. Then M is invertible if",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2iggF",
      "text": "The first column of M is the transpose of the second row of M",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fCYAr",
      "text": "The second row of M is the transpose of the first column of M",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "O6PeQ",
      "text": "M is a diagonal matrix with non - zero entries in the main diagonal",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AbYsc",
      "text": "The product of entries in the main diagonal of M is not the square of an integer",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let  <math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math>   (where a, b, c  <math><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></math> ) <br >Then Det  <math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> <br >If  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >If  <math><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>b</mi><mi> </mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >If  <math><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi> </mi><mo>≠</mo><mi> </mi></math> square of integer,  <math><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
